<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#NioshControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Controls are measures that maintain and/or modify risk. In the NIOSH hierarchy, a control is a measure that is in place, is working effectively and operating to reduce either the likelihood or impact of a risk."@en .
