# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#NioshControl> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-05-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Nick McDonald" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personal protective equipment (PPE) includes clothing and devices to protect workers. PPE needs constant effort and attention (including proper use and training) from workers. Higher-level controls aren’t always feasible, and PPE might be needed in conjunction with other control measures. Least effective contols."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Personal protective equipment"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Personal protective equipment (PPE) includes clothing and devices to protect workers. PPE needs constant effort and attention (including proper use and training) from workers. Higher-level controls aren’t always feasible, and PPE might be needed in conjunction with other control measures. Least effective contols."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlsOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personal protective equipment"@en .
